# Anti-Patterns Quick Reference

| Don't | Do |
|-------|-----|
| **Claim "done" without runtime verification** | **Run code, wait 8-10s, check terminal for errors, verify output** |
| **Run quality gates standalone** | **Use quickmerge (includes all quality gates automatically)** |
| **Dependencies differ but no --dep-branch** | **Use quickmerge --dep-branch for proper isolation and cascade** |
| Commit deps change without uv.lock | Run quickmerge (auto-runs quality gates + `uv lock`); commit uv.lock |
| `pip install` (except `pip install uv`) | `uv pip install` |
| `os.getenv('KEY', '')` | `config.key_name` |
| `from google.cloud import storage` | `get_storage_client()` |
| `print()` | `logger.info()` |
| `datetime.now()` | `datetime.now(timezone.utc)` |
| Bare `except:` | `@handle_api_errors` |
| `git push main` or `bash scripts/quality-gates.sh` | `quickmerge.sh`; use `--dep-branch` when deps differ |
| Imports in functions | Imports at top |
| TODO in code | GitHub issue |
| File >900 lines | Split by SRP |
| Create `test_*_extended.py` files | Expand existing test files |
| Duplicate fixtures across test files | Use singleton fixtures from conftest.py |
| `except Exception:` in production | `@handle_api_errors` or specific exceptions |
| Relax reportAny/reportUnknown* | Only audited exceptions — document in QUALITY_GATE_BYPASS_AUDIT.md |
| `basedpyright .` or `basedpyright` (no args) | `timeout 120 basedpyright <source_dir>/` |
| Keep parallel code paths after refactor | Single code path; delete old — see delete-deprecated.mdc |
| `setup_cloud_logging`, `os.getenv()` after correction | Remind rules or start fresh session — rule amnesia detected |

**Rule amnesia:** If agent uses `os.getenv()`, `pip install`, `git push main`, or `setup_cloud_logging` after being corrected → stop and start a fresh session.

